msgid ""
"Odoo20 Accounting, Accounting Kit, Accounting for community, odoo "
"accounting, accounting reports for community, community accounting, odoo20 "
"account reports, odoo20, accounting"
msgstr ""
"Odoo20 Buchhaltung, Accounting Kit, Buchhaltung für Community, Odoo "
